    {
      "text": "voice of warning shall be unto all people, D&C 1:4. bring forth and establish the cause of Zion, D&C 6:6. called to bring to pass the gathering of mine elect, D&C 29:7. this church have I established, D&C 33:5. sent forth to preach the everlasting gospel, D&C 36:5. teach the principles of my gospel, D&C 42:12. not sent forth to be taught, but to teach, D&C 43:15. must needs flee unto Zion for safety, D&C 45:68. Missouri … consecrated for the gathering of the saints, D&C 57:1. gospel must be preached unto every creature, D&C 58:64. from thence shall the gospel roll forth, D&C 65:2. unto whom much is given much is required, D&C 82:3. Zion must increase in beauty, and in holiness, D&C 82:14. New Jerusalem shall be built by the gathering of the saints, D&C 84:4. bring forth fruit meet for their Father’s kingdom, D&C 84:58. light unto the Gentiles, D&C 86:11. gather together, and stand in holy places, D&C 101:22. they are accounted as the salt of the earth, D&C 101:39. redemption of Zion must needs come, D&C 103:15. church may come forth out of the wilderness, D&C 109:73. put on the authority of the priesthood, D&C 113:8. Arise and shine forth, D&C 115:5. holy house, which my people are always commanded to build, D&C 124:39. their salvation is necessary and essential to our salvation, D&C 128:15. present … the records of our dead, D&C 128:24. gather ye out from among the nations, D&C 133:7. by the hands of the … children of Ephraim, D&C 133:32. gospel shall be preached unto every nation, D&C 133:37. prepare the weak for those things which are coming, D&C 133:58. among the righteous … appointed messengers, D&C 138:30. faithful elders … continue their labors in the preaching, D&C 138:57.",
